  "body": "Limit 1 per deck. Uses (0 secrets).\nWhen you purchase this card, choose 1 chaos token in the chaos bag and record <i>chosen token has been marked by Yoth</i> in your campaign log. Then, search your bonded cards for 1 copy of Issith and add it to your deck. It does not count toward your deck size.\n⭕ After you reveal the chosen token during a skill test: Place 1 secret on this card. Then, if Stolen Idol of Yoth has 5 or more secrets on it, place it in the victory display. (Limit once per phase.)",
